{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S11、S12等短停留段把多个心理转折合成长句，扫读节奏比X更吃力。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把许多原先依赖小字补足的动机、转折和内心顾虑放进大字，观众即使不仔细读小字，也更容易抓住每段的完整意思。尤其从S03到S12，人物从怀念、动摇、孤独到重新安顿自己的心理变化，在Y中更连贯，情绪也更有层次。X的短句更利于快速扫读，但综合理解、人物动机和情感细腻度，Y略胜。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "015fe0bc-2ebc-4116-a548-1d59a285f649", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T191021166990Z", "elapsed_seconds": 80.578, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:11:41.769232+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7a530a9ae235ac26d89285aa5cf2e6e42a0e1cff76fb19ec1265844ae02ea09e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a737